    "text": {
     "en": "(additional, not in the textbook) Fractions can also describe part of a group. Half of 8 is 4, because 8 shared into 2 equal groups gives 4 each.\nA quarter of 8 is 2, because 8 shared into 4 equal groups gives 2 each.\nHalf of 12 is 6. A quarter of 12 is 3.\nTo find half, divide into 2 equal groups. To find a quarter, divide into 4 equal groups."
    }
